<title>UK: BBC sees Labour majority of 189 seats after 107 results.</title>
<headline>BBC sees Labour majority of 189 seats after 107 results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The first 107 results in the British election suggest an average swing to Labour of 9.5 percent, the British Broadcasting Corporation said on Friday.</p>
<p>If this swing is replicated across the country, Labour will form the next government with a majority of around 189 seats, it said.</p>
</text>
